    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not that simple though. it's not like i can just \"start a hobby\" or something. my whole life is mapped out. every choice i make is already decided by them. it feels like i'm just a character in a play i didn't even write. i feel like i'm suffocating under all these rules and i can't breathe sometimes. there's just no room for me to exist as myself.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
