      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of being a puppet in someone else's life is suffocating, and it's completely understandable why you feel trapped. If the entire map is set by others, perhaps you can find a small, invisible way to carve out your own space. Even tiny moments of rebellion—a private thought, a secret glance at something you love—can be a way to reclaim a sliver of your own existence. Don't underestimate the power of those quiet, personal acts of defiance.",
      "source": "target",
