      "role": "user",
      "content": "tiny acts of defiance... i dont know if that's enough. a secret thought doesn't change the fact that my future is already gone. it's like being buried alive. i just keep thinking about what it would be like to actually be free. to have real control for once, instead of just pretending to be okay while i slowly disappear. i want an escape that actually works.",
